  <figcaption class="border-t border-surface-variant px-4 py-3 font-body text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-secondary md:px-6">
    Switching the model or harness does not move the project, Git history, or owned local substrate. Integration depth can vary by route, and policy, audit, output shaping, and optimistic-concurrency behavior apply according to the kernel-mediated verb being used.
    <span class="block mt-2 text-primary md:hidden">Scroll horizontally to inspect every label.</span>
  </figcaption>
